    "detailed_description": "Play for 1-4 people where you venture into a camp where your goal is to escape the place.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo escape, you'll need to increase your campfire's light by collecting logs, open doors using hidden keys, collect items such as a saw that will be used to cut a tree and take the item from its interior as well as to stun a zombie for some time, but remember sure zombies are zombies, they revive!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are also useless items that will serve you to have to drop a good item and in the end not serve and occupy your inventory<br />\r\n<br />\r\nbut, to make your mission more difficult, one player will be a zombie and will have the objective of turning the others into zombies. when the zombie finds its victim, the victim will also become a zombie<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is not easy to clear all levels, imagine clearing 100% of the achievements",
    "about_the_game": "Play for 1-4 people where you venture into a camp where your goal is to escape the place.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo escape, you'll need to increase your campfire's light by collecting logs, open doors using hidden keys, collect items such as a saw that will be used to cut a tree and take the item from its interior as well as to stun a zombie for some time, but remember sure zombies are zombies, they revive!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are also useless items that will serve you to have to drop a good item and in the end not serve and occupy your inventory<br />\r\n<br />\r\nbut, to make your mission more difficult, one player will be a zombie and will have the objective of turning the others into zombies. when the zombie finds its victim, the victim will also become a zombie<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is not easy to clear all levels, imagine clearing 100% of the achievements",
    "short_description": "Survive and RUN... Survive a massacre at the camp as you grab keys and logs to get out and increase the explorable area Can you Beat the game in the hardest difficulty and unlock 100% of all the achivements",
